            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Help protect yourself and your workplace from medium hazardous dust. The WD M38 PCF 110V has been independently certified for the safe extraction of moderate hazardous dusts, from concrete, Silica, MDF, natural woods and more. Removing 99.9% of dust with an occupational exposure limit value of &gt; 0.1 mg/m3.</p>",
